{"4405880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moon Corona", "steam_appid": 4405880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BLEND DECKBUILDING WITH STORY-DRIVEN CHOICES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The depth of card strategy? The immersion of role-playing? The weight of fateful choices? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to choose—here, you can have it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/691a06bdc37e7eeadeaa7a7495e0e3e1.avif?t=1788234963\" width=1200 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AWAKEN IN AN ANCIENT TEMPLE AND BEGIN YOUR QUEST</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero, long asleep in the ancient temple, has reached the day of departure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect scattered cards across the Duchy of Reinhart, build your own deck to grow stronger, gather the whispers along your journey to unlock the story, and set off on an adventure to uncover the lost truth and redemption hidden within <strong>Moon Crown</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/ed1c20f01ddd7038fc0946b88dd1513f.poster.avif?t=1788234963\" width=980 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/ed1c20f01ddd7038fc0946b88dd1513f.webm?t=1788234963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/ed1c20f01ddd7038fc0946b88dd1513f.mp4?t=1788234963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TRAVERSE CASTLES, WILDERNESS, AND FORGOTTEN DUNGEONS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse castles, wilderness, villages, cities, cathedrals, and dungeons—each place bears the mark of lost memories </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger encounters in exploration, rewrite the story, and unlock forgotten inheritances </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is not only for you to walk through. It awaits your intervention in the course of its fate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/3de73fcb31b2f5157e1499738c306af0.poster.avif?t=1788234963\" width=980 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/3de73fcb31b2f5157e1499738c306af0.webm?t=1788234963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/3de73fcb31b2f5157e1499738c306af0.mp4?t=1788234963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FORGE A CUSTOM DECK AND SHAPE YOUR OWN PLAYSTYLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hundreds of cards with distinct effects—mix and match freely, with no fixed templates </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class-exclusive cards: define your combat style and unleash unique combos </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Universal combo cards: cover weaknesses, break class boundaries, and build limitless possibilities </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee mage, high-defense hunter, agile berserker… if you can imagine it, you can build it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/0cc97719948165156bfccd57f82b6136.poster.avif?t=1788234963\" width=980 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/0cc97719948165156bfccd57f82b6136.webm?t=1788234963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/0cc97719948165156bfccd57f82b6136.mp4?t=1788234963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNLOCK 40+ DISTINCT CLASSES AND BUILD WITHOUT LIMITS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from five base classes and step onto the path to godhood across the Reinhart continent— </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barbarian, Elemental Master, Demolition Maniac… define your own way with over 40 advanced classes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no standard answers here—only your one-of-a-kind playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/3f231beb323423d14adb1637c26bf244.poster.avif?t=1788234963\" width=980 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/3f231beb323423d14adb1637c26bf244.webm?t=1788234963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/3f231beb323423d14adb1637c26bf244.mp4?t=1788234963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MASTER MULTI-LAYER TACTICAL COMBAT WITH SKILLFUL MOVEMENT</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part-breaking system: target weak points, shatter armor, and turn the tide in an instant </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement-based combat: positioning, dodging, terrain kills, spacing and kiting—execution is strategy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use factions against each other: win with wit rather than brute strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/8e8a8cec37b0805a3822808c2a5a59be.poster.avif?t=1788234963\" width=1100 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/8e8a8cec37b0805a3822808c2a5a59be.webm?t=1788234963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/8e8a8cec37b0805a3822808c2a5a59be.mp4?t=1788234963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNRAVEL THE LOST TRUTH BEHIND REINHART’S SHADOW WAR</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crown and the church wage a shadow war; divine grace and curses coexist; magic clashes with steel; chaos and order spiral in a cycle… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the ordinary people swept up by the torrent—your choices will become their only light. But remember: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every fate can be saved, just as not every darkness longs to be illuminated…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/691a06bdc37e7eeadeaa7a7495e0e3e1.avif?t=1788234963\" width=1200 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Open your eyes in the ancient temple—add to your wishlist! Let’s adventure together】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405880/extras/691a06bdc37e7eeadeaa7a7495e0e3e1.avif?t=1788234963\" width=1200 height=97 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BLEND DECKBUILDING WITH STORY-DRIVEN CHOICES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 